        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Emma Willis, Marvin Humes, will.i.am, Ricky Wilson, Kevin Simm\n- TV Series: The Voice UK (series 5)\n- Music Releases: Brand New\n- Roles: host, coach, disc jockey, radio host\n\nFacts:\n- Marvin Humes was born on 18 March 1985.\n- Marvin Humes is an English disc jockey and radio host.\n- Marvin Humes currently presents the late show across the UK's Capital FM Network and the Vodafone Big Top 40 chart show across UK commercial radio stations on Sunday afternoons.\n- The Voice UK series 5 is hosted by Emma Willis and Marvin Humes.\n- The Voice UK series 5 includes will.i.am and Ricky Wilson as coaches.\n- Kevin Simm won The Voice UK on 9 April 2016.\n- Brand New is the debut solo album by Kevin Simm, a former Liberty X band member.",
